  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(196)/(0.196)=(19.6)/(n)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ (196)/(0.196)=(19.6)/(n)\n\n⇒(196 times 1000)/(196)=(196)/(10n)\n\n⇒ 1000=(196)/(10n)\n\n⇒ 10000n = 196\n\n⇒ 0.0196\n\n**∴ Option 4 is the correct answer.**",
